    [2a], [#strong[Consecrate];], [In a scene of prayer, bless water or blades. The old rites call for silver in the water: blessed water and blades count as #emph[silvered] (Frontier Rules §8.1) for the mission. This grants the listed silvered benefit, not an additional killing method or a status on ordinary conflict Attacks.],
    [2b], [#strong[Last Rites];], [Once per scene, every ally who can hear your prayer restores 2 Pneuma, and Resists fear with Edge +1 until the scene ends. Pool recovery does not clear statuses, restore Disposition or erase Scars.],
